   "t1": 11.65,
   "spk": "DISPATCH",
   "text": "Unit 12, welfare check, 61 Hollis Road. Neighbor says the resident hasn't been seen in two weeks, but the lights come on every night."
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.0,
   "t1": 14.21,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "12, copy. En route."
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.81,
   "t1": 19.85,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "12, on scene. Front door's wide open. Going in."
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.2,
   "t1": 27.31,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "Dispatch, every mirror in this house is covered. Sheets, towels, tape. Every single one."
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.66,
   "t1": 31.12,
   "spk": "DISPATCH",
   "text": "Copy, 12. Any sign of the resident?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.47,
   "t1": 36.04,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "Negative. There's a plate on the kitchen table. The food's still warm."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.39,
   "t1": 40.54,
   "spk": "DISPATCH",
   "text": "12, be advised, neighbor says he lived alone."
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.54,
   "t1": 44.54,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "Dispatch... I hear someone walking upstairs."
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.89,
   "t1": 48.94,
   "spk": "DISPATCH",
   "text": "12, backup is six minutes out. Hold your position."
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.29,
   "t1": 53.83,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "There's a note taped to the stairs. It says... don't uncover them."
  },
  {
   "t0": 54.23,
   "t1": 57.25,
   "spk": "UNIT 12",
   "text": "Hey! Police! Don't move! Don't move!"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.65,
